,{"sha":"8cc64983541b7cf203db5d4fd3201b69e3afdf72","node_id":"C_kwDOP-YQ3toAKDhjYzY0OTgzNTQxYjdjZjIwM2RiNWQ0ZmQzMjAxYjY5ZTNhZmRmNzI","commit":{"author":{"name":"omrisegev","email":"omrisegev.os@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-11T04:29:29Z"},"committer":{"name":"omrisegev","email":"omrisegev.os@gmail.com","date":"2026-10-11T04:29:29Z"},"message":"Re-score PRMBench/ProcessBench on the think-fix teacher-forced cells (mask1)\n\nQwen3 PRMBench and ProcessBench (8B, 4B) telemetry was regenerated with the\nempty think block in the teacher-forcing prefix (claude/tf-think-block-fix).\nThis commit adds the CPU re-score of the frozen Monday scorers on that\ntelemetry, unchanged except for the input.\n\n- spectral_utils/first_token_mask.py + tests: the mask1 rule (drop forced\n  token 0, shift spans; an emptied step raises). 0 failures in every cell.\n- scripts/rebuild_source_bank_v4.py: rebuilds external_banks_v4\n  source/FEATURES.npz from raw telemetry with the frozen gates' per-answer\n  code (claude/ssl-pseudolabel-residual-v1 @ 553de79c6). Old raw cells\n  reproduce the frozen bank to 6.1e-7 (gate 1e-6).\n- results/thinkfix_rescore_v1: wrappers that run patched copies of\n  monday_nested_banks_v2/dev_run.py and monday_cont_baselines_v1/run.py\n  (input bank, output dir, export hook; DIFF.txt beside each), old replay /\n  thinkfix / thinkfix_mask1 outputs, OLD vs NEW comparison tables and the\n  mask1 PRMScore inputs (prmscore_inputs/bank_<BANK>.npz).\n\nPRMBench within-answer AUC (mask1 minus old) averages -0.0088 over 10 banks\nx 5 headline scorers; N16 MEAN_MOM_ga 0.7909 -> 0.7767. Supervised LR follows\nin a separate commit. See results/thinkfix_rescore_v1/README.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3ea9a085220c7ce82805213319c0a0544991af08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omrisegev/hallucination_detection/git/trees/3ea9a085220c7ce82805213319c0a0544991af08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omrisegev/hallucination_detection/git/commits/8cc64983541b7cf203db5d4fd3201b69e3afdf72","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omrisegev/hallucination_detection/commits/8cc64983541b7cf203db5d4fd3201b69e3afdf72","html_url":"https://github.com/omrisegev/hallucination_detection/commit/8cc64983541b7cf203db5d4fd3201b69e3afdf72","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/omrisegev/hallucination_detection/commits/8cc64983541b7cf203db5d4fd3201b69e3afdf72/comments","author":{"login":"omrisegev","id":68779075,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4Nzc5MDc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68779075?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omrisegev","html_url":"https://github.com/omrisegev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omrisegev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omrisegev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omrisegev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omrisegev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omrisegev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omrisegev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omrisegev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omrisegev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omrisegev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"omrisegev","id":68779075,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4Nzc5MDc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68779075?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/omrisegev","html_url":"https://github.com/omrisegev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omrisegev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omrisegev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/omrisegev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":